of a rough jump.


00:27:02.664 --> 00:27:05.333
- Just do it.
- As you wish.


00:31:50.660 --> 00:31:52.578
Could you put the kettle on
for me?


00:31:54.497 --> 00:31:56.582
Oh. Yeah, of course.


00:32:08.469 --> 00:32:09.846
You smell good.


00:32:10.930 --> 00:32:12.432
I need a shower.


00:32:22.233 --> 00:32:24.110
