last night.


00:32:50.011 --> 00:32:53.389
I couldn't get a flight
until late. Barely slept.


00:32:53.681 --> 00:32:55.057
How was the trip?


00:32:56.267 --> 00:32:57.268
Thrilling.


00:32:57.810 --> 00:33:00.041
Throomatics
demoed the new software,


00:33:00.042 --> 00:33:02.273
