team-building game.


00:33:04.275 --> 00:33:06.152
How was the rest
of your rotation?


00:33:09.906 --> 00:33:11.657
What's with you today?


00:33:13.451 --> 00:33:14.660
What do you mean?


00:33:15.453 --> 00:33:19.248
- What do you mean?
- I don't know.


00:33:27.548 --> 00:33:29.634
You've gone strange on me.


00:35:03.185 --> 00:35:05.396
